WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:10.370
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:10.640 --> 03:12.840
-Chayanee. -Don't raise your voice at me.

3
03:12.920 --> 03:16.000
I was asking her to help campaign for me.

4
03:16.080 --> 03:17.480
I told you

5
03:17.560 --> 03:20.120
not to have Hathaya campaign for you.

6
03:20.200 --> 03:22.400
Why do you want to help him

7
03:22.480 --> 03:24.840
after the way he's treated you?

8
03:24.920 --> 03:27.360
I want Papang to be proud of his dad.

9
03:29.480 --> 03:30.800
I want you

10
03:30.880 --> 03:32.680
to get close to Hathai.

11
03:32.760 --> 03:36.200
There are all kinds of scammers out there these days.

12
03:36.280 --> 03:38.360
Be careful.

13
03:39.080 --> 03:41.920
You got her all the way to the den. Why did you let her leave?

14
03:42.000 --> 03:43.360
I did everything I could, madam.

15
03:44.240 --> 03:45.040
Wait.

16
03:45.120 --> 03:48.240
Give me another chance. Do you know

17
03:49.040 --> 03:51.040
I even went to a spa?

18
03:52.600 --> 03:54.200
You can feel for yourself.

19
03:54.280 --> 03:56.400
Actually, I'd like you

20
03:57.440 --> 03:58.720
to feel my whole body.

21
04:00.640 --> 04:02.000
Start here,

22
04:02.600 --> 04:04.880
and slowly work your way down.

23
04:06.480 --> 04:08.840
Why did you stop, madam?

24
04:13.640 --> 04:16.959
I already told you. Whenever I come here,

25
04:17.040 --> 04:18.440
close the door.

26
04:36.120 --> 04:36.960
Of course.

27
04:48.200 --> 04:51.480
Come on, everyone. Let's hear it for our new subdistrict chief,

28
04:51.560 --> 04:53.240
Chief Raiwin.

29
04:53.320 --> 04:55.200
Thank you very much, everyone.

30
04:55.920 --> 04:57.600
I promise

31
04:57.680 --> 04:59.240
I will move forward with everything

32
04:59.320 --> 05:00.760
I pledged during the campaign.

33
05:00.840 --> 05:02.560
I'll improve quality of life,

34
05:02.640 --> 05:05.280
create income opportunities, and promote education.

35
05:05.360 --> 05:07.280
I want everyone to have the knowledge and skills

36
05:08.200 --> 05:09.640
to support their own families.

37
05:09.720 --> 05:12.560
Let's hear it for our new subdistrict chief. A chief for the people.

38
05:12.640 --> 05:16.560
Chief Raiwin. Come on, applaud.

39
05:16.640 --> 05:17.720
Mr. Raiwin.

40
05:17.800 --> 05:21.080
There are reports that vote-buying took place during this election.

41
05:21.160 --> 05:22.240
What do you say to that?

42
05:25.680 --> 05:27.720
I admit there was vote-buying.

43
05:30.400 --> 05:31.920
Miss Chayanee, is that true?

44
05:33.760 --> 05:35.280
But not by Chief Raiwin.

45
05:36.080 --> 05:37.760
Raiwin

46
05:37.840 --> 05:40.440
worked incredibly hard and ran an honest campaign.

47
05:40.520 --> 05:44.200
He went door to door until I don't even know how many pairs of shoes he wore out.

48
05:46.040 --> 05:49.000
I promise you, and I give you my word,

49
05:49.080 --> 05:50.840
that the two of us will make sure

50
05:50.920 --> 05:52.600
everyone can live well and prosper.

51
05:52.680 --> 05:54.120
Indeed.

52
05:55.360 --> 05:59.000
Applaud. A chief for the people.

53
05:59.080 --> 06:01.040
-Applaud. -Applaud, everyone.

54
06:01.120 --> 06:02.920
A chief for the people.

55
06:03.000 --> 06:04.400
Applaud.

56
06:04.480 --> 06:06.680
Applaud. Come on.

57
06:06.760 --> 06:07.920
Hey, Ramil.

58
06:08.000 --> 06:08.880
Hello, big brother.

59
06:08.960 --> 06:10.640
-Thanks. -Hello, everyone.

60
06:10.720 --> 06:13.640
I'm the subdistrict chief's younger brother.

61
06:15.680 --> 06:16.760
Thank you.

62
06:18.400 --> 06:20.240
I'm here to congratulate him as his brother.

63
06:20.960 --> 06:23.560
And from this point on,

64
06:23.640 --> 06:25.760
I'm going to do my duty as a good citizen.

65
06:25.840 --> 06:27.600
What do you mean by that, Mr. Ramil?

66
06:28.400 --> 06:32.320
Being a good citizen doesn't end with voting.

67
06:33.080 --> 06:34.360
From now on,

68
06:34.440 --> 06:37.360
I'm going to scrutinize everything the subdistrict chief does.

69
06:38.440 --> 06:41.560
Every baht he spends is taxpayers' money.

70
06:42.680 --> 06:46.360
And please help spread the word. If anyone has information

71
06:46.440 --> 06:48.720
about misconduct or corruption,

72
06:49.320 --> 06:52.480
you can contact me directly. I'll gladly act as an intermediary.

73
06:52.560 --> 06:54.960
Doesn't doing that suggest

74
06:55.040 --> 06:58.000
you don't trust your own brother?

75
06:58.080 --> 07:01.280
Not at all. The subdistrict chief,

76
07:01.800 --> 07:03.400
Mr. Saksit,

77
07:04.120 --> 07:06.920
and Miss Chayanee all promised to follow through on their policies

78
07:07.000 --> 07:08.520
and commitments.

79
07:08.600 --> 07:10.280
So there's nothing

80
07:12.000 --> 07:12.840
to worry about.

81
07:14.800 --> 07:16.080
Right?

82
07:16.760 --> 07:18.040
Right?

83
07:20.440 --> 07:22.640
Then let's get a photo of everyone together.

84
07:22.720 --> 07:24.400
Yes. Here.

85
07:24.480 --> 07:25.640
Stand a little closer.

86
07:25.720 --> 07:28.200
Former subdistrict chief, come join us.

87
07:35.320 --> 07:36.960
Come over here, Chief.

88
07:38.920 --> 07:40.720
A little closer.

89
07:40.800 --> 07:43.240
Beautiful. One more.

90
07:43.320 --> 07:45.920
One, two, three.

91
07:46.000 --> 07:48.000
Very good. Great.

92
07:48.080 --> 07:50.440
Perfect.

93
07:54.440 --> 07:57.000
I'm just doing what's right.

94
07:57.760 --> 08:01.240
You've done your duty as a citizen. Let's go back to work.

95
08:01.320 --> 08:02.400
Ramil.

96
08:05.640 --> 08:08.120
Uncle, keep your voice down.

97
08:08.720 --> 08:11.480
The reporters might write

98
08:11.560 --> 08:12.960
that our family is fighting.

99
08:13.040 --> 08:16.000
Is this how people who love each other behave?

100
08:17.840 --> 08:19.040
What you're doing

101
08:19.920 --> 08:21.520
isn't something family does.

102
08:22.120 --> 08:24.040
You already see me as a parasite anyway.

103
08:25.120 --> 08:26.880
I'm not really family to you.

104
08:27.720 --> 08:30.200
I'm just doing my duty as a good citizen.

105
08:30.720 --> 08:31.840
Good citizen, my ass.

106
08:31.920 --> 08:34.440
You're looking for a chance to catch me doing something wrong.

107
08:34.520 --> 08:35.840
You're trying to hurt us.

108
08:35.919 --> 08:38.000
You've been in politics so long

109
08:38.760 --> 08:40.200
that you think you're untouchable.

110
08:40.280 --> 08:43.440
But the world has changed. You can buy votes,

111
08:44.039 --> 08:45.680
but you don't control everyone.

112
08:48.920 --> 08:50.440
Everyone has a phone now.

113
08:50.520 --> 08:52.960
And from now on,

114
08:53.040 --> 08:56.400
this is the weapon people will use against old-school,

115
08:56.480 --> 08:57.840
power-hungry figures like you.

116
08:58.440 --> 08:59.600
Dad.

117
09:01.400 --> 09:04.320
Don't. The reporters are still around.

118
09:06.200 --> 09:07.040
Ramil.

119
09:07.120 --> 09:09.840
I promise I won't stray from the right path.

120
09:11.200 --> 09:14.080
I'll work hard and show the people that

121
09:14.680 --> 09:15.760
I came here to serve them.

122
09:17.320 --> 09:18.320
I'll be watching.

123
09:25.840 --> 09:27.680
Uncle, don't waste your time on them.

124
09:28.240 --> 09:30.680
Ungrateful parasites.

125
09:31.280 --> 09:34.720
Everything Chayanee said is absolutely right.

126
09:35.600 --> 09:37.240
She said exactly what I was thinking.

127
09:40.040 --> 09:41.840
He's jealous

128
09:41.920 --> 09:44.600
because my son is rising in the world.

129
09:46.480 --> 09:50.520
How about we go somewhere nice and have a meal?

130
09:50.600 --> 09:53.880
We'll celebrate our new subdistrict chief.

131
09:54.880 --> 09:59.440
Good idea. Let's go somewhere nice and expensive

132
10:00.200 --> 10:02.400
for my chief.

133
10:02.480 --> 10:03.440
-Come on. -Let's go.

134
10:20.920 --> 10:23.120
Yai, have you eaten yet?

135
10:25.040 --> 10:27.440
Are you angry with me about something?

136
10:27.520 --> 10:29.480
You haven't read my messages in days.

137
10:39.320 --> 10:41.880
Ms. Hathai. Ms. Hathai.

138
10:41.960 --> 10:44.640
The soup is boiling. Ms. Hathai.

139
10:45.760 --> 10:47.880
What? Did it burn?

140
10:47.960 --> 10:49.320
Not yet.

141
10:51.240 --> 10:53.840
Is something bothering you?

142
10:55.360 --> 10:56.400
No.

143
10:59.400 --> 11:01.080
Madam Hathai,

144
11:01.160 --> 11:03.040
is Father's food ready yet?

145
11:03.120 --> 11:05.120
I've already prepared it. You can take it out.

146
11:09.240 --> 11:10.080
Where's the rice?

147
11:13.080 --> 11:13.920
I forgot.

148
11:16.400 --> 11:19.560
No rice? Is Father supposed to feast on air?

149
11:22.880 --> 11:27.520
Madam, do you think Ms. Hathai ate something that disagreed with her?

150
11:27.600 --> 11:28.640
Oh.

151
11:28.720 --> 11:31.440
Or is something troubling her?

152
11:31.520 --> 11:33.880
She looks so gloomy.

153
11:33.960 --> 11:34.800
Oh?

154
11:35.440 --> 11:39.280
Almost like someone with a broken heart.

155
11:40.000 --> 11:43.120
Chamoi, you really just say whatever comes into your head.

156
11:44.360 --> 11:47.880
Ever since Hathai became a widow,

157
11:47.960 --> 11:51.080
I haven't seen her get involved with any man.

158
11:51.160 --> 11:52.160
Really?

159
11:52.240 --> 11:55.280
Madam, I saw her the other day.

160
11:55.360 --> 11:58.280
She was chatting on her phone and giggling away.

161
11:58.360 --> 12:02.240
But these past few days,

162
12:02.320 --> 12:05.680
she's been sitting there chatting all by herself.

163
12:05.760 --> 12:09.320
No giggling. No smiling. For days.

164
12:11.720 --> 12:12.920
Wait.

165
12:13.000 --> 12:15.400
Don't stay a widow too long.

166
12:15.480 --> 12:17.520
You don't have that many years left. Enjoy your life.

167
12:18.200 --> 12:20.000
Find yourself a new husband

168
12:20.080 --> 12:22.200
and get far away from me.

169
12:23.840 --> 12:27.400
Good luck. I'm rooting for you.

170
12:47.440 --> 12:50.000
Ann, finish setting everything up for me.

171
12:50.080 --> 12:51.120
Of course.

172
12:56.680 --> 12:58.200
Hello, Yai.

173
13:00.040 --> 13:03.960
You ignored my messages. I thought you were done with me.

174
13:04.040 --> 13:08.240
Not at all. I've been overseas constantly lately.

175
13:08.320 --> 13:11.160
Right now I'm taking care of the minister's family again.

176
13:11.240 --> 13:15.920
And on my next trip, I have to take care of the PM's family too.

177
13:17.000 --> 13:20.480
I'm glad you contacted me.

178
13:21.800 --> 13:24.880
I thought you were angry

179
13:25.560 --> 13:27.400
because I wouldn't stay with you that day.

180
13:27.480 --> 13:30.280
Not at all. I don't want to pressure you.

181
13:30.880 --> 13:32.440
Will we

182
13:34.000 --> 13:35.560
get to see each other again?

183
13:37.880 --> 13:40.120
When I get back from Italy,

184
13:40.200 --> 13:43.280
I'll probably relax with my friends at the same place again.

185
13:43.920 --> 13:47.960
But I know you don't like places like that.

186
13:49.120 --> 13:50.360
I shouldn't pressure you.

187
13:53.080 --> 13:54.600
I have to go, Hathai.

188
13:54.680 --> 13:56.760
The minister's wife just arrived.

189
13:57.360 --> 13:58.440
All right.

190
14:01.840 --> 14:03.720
You let the fish get away this time.

191
14:03.800 --> 14:06.880
Next time, don't let it slip off the hook.

192
14:07.480 --> 14:09.480
I'm still playing mind games with her.

193
14:10.000 --> 14:13.240
But I don't know if I'm doing it well enough.

194
14:17.080 --> 14:19.320
Maybe you could teach me, madam.

195
14:34.040 --> 14:36.080
I want to see you again.

196
14:45.200 --> 14:47.760
Where are you going? It isn't lunch break yet.

197
14:47.840 --> 14:51.640
Miss Chayanee's treating everyone since her boyfriend was elected chief.

198
14:51.720 --> 14:52.600
Come with us.

199
14:52.680 --> 14:55.440
That's okay. I still haven't finished going through the accounts.

200
14:55.520 --> 14:57.680
All right. I'll bring you something back.

201
14:57.760 --> 14:58.920
Thank you.

202
15:15.680 --> 15:16.880
Thank you.

203
15:17.600 --> 15:19.040
You shouldn't be in here.

204
15:19.640 --> 15:20.920
I brought you some food.

205
15:21.000 --> 15:24.680
But Chayanee won't see it that way. I don't want any trouble.

206
15:26.880 --> 15:28.400
We got so much.

207
15:28.480 --> 15:29.560
We can split it.

208
15:29.640 --> 15:32.320
Wait. Have you seen my boyfriend?

209
15:33.080 --> 15:35.200
Mr. Raiwin took some food into the office.

210
15:35.280 --> 15:36.760
For who?

211
15:37.840 --> 15:39.240
Miss Hathaya.

212
15:40.600 --> 15:42.200
Hathaya.

213
15:46.760 --> 15:49.160
Thank you for the food,

214
15:49.240 --> 15:50.600
but you should go, Raiwin.

215
15:50.680 --> 15:52.760
Don't worry so much about what she thinks.

216
15:52.840 --> 15:55.240
There's nothing inappropriate about me talking to you.

217
15:56.880 --> 15:58.440
Then if you won't leave,

218
15:59.000 --> 16:00.400
I will.

219
16:03.080 --> 16:04.080
Hathaya.

220
16:11.320 --> 16:13.360
Hathaya.

221
16:13.440 --> 16:14.960
Listen to me first.

222
16:15.640 --> 16:18.040
Do you know why I still have feelings for you?

223
16:18.880 --> 16:21.840
Because you care about other people's feelings.

224
16:22.600 --> 16:25.920
And you're the only woman who ever really listens to me.

225
16:27.760 --> 16:29.800
Please let go of my hand.

226
16:30.800 --> 16:32.560
I should never have let Ramil have you.

227
16:33.400 --> 16:34.800
What are you talking about?

228
16:34.880 --> 16:36.800
You're with Chayanee.

229
16:37.400 --> 16:38.720
If I could,

230
16:39.400 --> 16:40.480
I'd break up with her.

231
16:44.320 --> 16:48.280
I'm telling you the truth. When I'm with you, when I talk to you,

232
16:48.960 --> 16:50.440
I feel at ease.

233
16:53.720 --> 16:57.400
But when I'm with Chayanee, I feel like a prisoner.

234
16:58.080 --> 17:01.560
She controls everything I do. I can't be myself at all.

235
17:04.240 --> 17:07.839
My whole life, I've lived under my father's shadow.

236
17:07.920 --> 17:09.520
I hoped that when I grew up,

237
17:09.599 --> 17:13.000
I'd finally have a life of my own. That I could become a good head of my family.

238
17:14.960 --> 17:17.280
But being with Chayanee is even worse.

239
17:19.880 --> 17:21.720
One day, if I can't take it anymore,

240
17:23.079 --> 17:24.640
I'll probably…

241
17:27.480 --> 17:28.400
You'll probably what?

242
17:33.280 --> 17:34.480
I asked

243
17:35.760 --> 17:37.040
what you'll do.

244
17:38.200 --> 17:39.400
Say it!

245
17:40.280 --> 17:42.000
Go on.

246
17:42.600 --> 17:44.360
I just brought some food for Hathaya.

247
17:47.560 --> 17:48.960
Let's go hand out the food.

248
17:52.920 --> 17:54.360
Come here.

249
17:57.480 --> 17:59.640
Chaya. Why did you slap me?

250
17:59.720 --> 18:01.400
You still have the nerve to ask?

251
18:02.240 --> 18:04.040
You're trying to steal Raiwin from me.

252
18:04.120 --> 18:06.720
You flirted with him and turned him against me.

253
18:06.800 --> 18:07.920
That's why he said such crazy stuff.

254
18:08.000 --> 18:09.600
That has nothing to do with me.

255
18:09.680 --> 18:11.880
It has everything to do with you.

256
18:11.960 --> 18:14.680
You're jealous because I'm going to be the chief's wife.

257
18:14.760 --> 18:16.240
You're trying to take all I have.

258
18:16.320 --> 18:18.080
Hey!

259
18:18.160 --> 18:19.840
-Chayanee! Stop! -Let go!

260
18:19.920 --> 18:21.280
Let go!

261
18:21.360 --> 18:24.320
If you try to stop me, I'll assume you're protecting your mistress.

262
18:27.840 --> 18:28.960
You slapped me?

263
18:29.040 --> 18:31.200
I'm trying to knock some sense into you.

264
18:31.280 --> 18:33.120
Stop acting crazy, Chayanee.

265
18:33.920 --> 18:35.800
You think I'm crazy?

266
18:35.880 --> 18:39.200
-Then I'll show you crazy. -Chaya, don't.

267
18:39.280 --> 18:40.640
Chaya, stop.

268
18:41.760 --> 18:42.840
Chayanee, stop!

269
18:42.920 --> 18:45.120
Back off! Stay out of this.

270
18:45.200 --> 18:46.960
I hate you.

271
18:47.040 --> 18:50.200
You're trying to take everything from me. I hate you!

272
18:50.280 --> 18:51.520
Stop!

273
18:51.600 --> 18:52.720
Let go.

274
18:55.200 --> 18:57.680
Let go. You!

275
18:58.280 --> 18:59.440
-Come here. -Raiwin,

276
18:59.520 --> 19:02.680
get your woman out of here. Get her out!

277
19:02.760 --> 19:05.040
-Let go. -Come here. Come on.

278
19:05.120 --> 19:06.360
-Let me go. -Get out here.

279
19:06.440 --> 19:08.360
I hate you. I hate you!

280
19:09.480 --> 19:11.160
I'll kill you!

281
19:12.360 --> 19:13.520
Hathaya.

282
19:14.200 --> 19:15.400
Are you okay?

283
19:36.040 --> 19:38.800
-Let go. -Stop, Chayanee.

284
19:38.880 --> 19:41.320
Stop. Calm down. Get a grip.

285
19:41.400 --> 19:44.280
She was trying to steal you.

286
19:44.360 --> 19:46.960
She slapped me. You have to press charges against her.

287
19:47.040 --> 19:50.520
You're the subdistrict chief now. You have to make her pay.

288
19:50.600 --> 19:52.640
She was defending herself.

289
19:52.720 --> 19:54.120
You started it.

290
19:54.200 --> 19:57.280
But you're my boyfriend. You're supposed to take my side.

291
19:57.360 --> 19:59.000
Listen to me.

292
20:00.280 --> 20:01.720
I've only just taken office.

293
20:01.800 --> 20:04.720
If damaging rumors come out now, who's going to respect me?

294
20:05.800 --> 20:07.640
Stop thinking only about yourself.

295
20:07.720 --> 20:09.960
Think about me for once.

296
20:10.040 --> 20:11.320
Do you understand?

297
20:13.680 --> 20:15.560
You don't love me anymore.

298
20:16.640 --> 20:18.120
You're going to leave me.

299
20:21.040 --> 20:22.800
Tell me.

300
20:24.120 --> 20:25.880
Tell me you still love me.

301
20:28.160 --> 20:29.320
Say it.

302
20:29.400 --> 20:31.280
Tell me!

303
20:33.000 --> 20:34.160
I still love you.

304
20:36.240 --> 20:38.280
I love you too.

305
20:38.360 --> 20:40.640
Please don't leave me.

306
21:09.400 --> 21:11.680
Sorry. It's you.

307
21:15.040 --> 21:16.080
Does it

308
21:17.000 --> 21:18.040
hurt badly?

309
21:19.480 --> 21:20.760
Just a little.

310
21:22.680 --> 21:24.360
Chayanee worries me.

311
21:25.440 --> 21:27.680
She gets more spoiled every day.

312
21:27.760 --> 21:29.480
Now she can't even control herself.

313
21:30.360 --> 21:32.280
Aunt Liu only has one daughter.

314
21:33.920 --> 21:36.280
Whatever Chayanee wanted, she always got.

315
21:38.120 --> 21:40.720
No one has ever been allowed to tell her no.

316
21:42.120 --> 21:44.600
I never wanted trouble with her either.

317
21:47.360 --> 21:50.240
But I can't keep letting her off the hook.

318
21:52.360 --> 21:53.920
What you did

319
21:55.000 --> 21:56.000
was right.

320
21:56.600 --> 22:00.040
Someone has to teach her right from wrong.

321
22:00.640 --> 22:02.480
Otherwise, people like her

322
22:03.240 --> 22:04.480
will cause problems for society.

323
22:08.680 --> 22:09.920
So…

324
22:10.880 --> 22:12.520
I'll…

325
22:15.600 --> 22:16.760
press this on for you.

326
22:18.400 --> 22:19.400
Oh.

327
22:23.680 --> 22:24.520
Okay.

328
22:45.040 --> 22:46.600
That hurts a little.

329
22:47.160 --> 22:48.320
Sorry.

330
22:49.040 --> 22:50.360
I've never done this before.

331
23:24.880 --> 23:26.600
-Aunt Ann. -Yes?

332
23:26.680 --> 23:28.040
Have you seen Mom?

333
23:28.120 --> 23:29.640
Madam?

334
23:29.720 --> 23:31.720
I saw her heading toward the main house.

335
23:32.880 --> 23:34.920
It's already dark. What is she doing over there?

336
23:35.000 --> 23:36.560
If I had to guess,

337
23:36.640 --> 23:39.760
she's probably going to deal with Miss Chayanee

338
23:39.840 --> 23:41.040
for hurting you.

339
23:49.600 --> 23:51.120
Madam.

340
23:51.200 --> 23:54.280
Here. Soy milk from that delicious place,

341
23:54.360 --> 23:57.960
with big, dense fried dough sticks. You'll be stuffed.

342
23:58.040 --> 23:59.040
Today,

343
23:59.120 --> 24:01.600
I don't need your soy milk.

344
24:01.680 --> 24:04.360
I'm already satisfied.

345
24:06.800 --> 24:09.720
Madam, what got into you?

346
24:11.840 --> 24:12.920
Where's your daughter?

347
24:13.000 --> 24:14.520
Why should I tell you?

348
24:15.360 --> 24:18.640
Where my daughter goes is her business.

349
24:18.720 --> 24:19.680
What's that to you?

350
24:19.760 --> 24:21.880
Your daughter slapped mine.

351
24:21.960 --> 24:23.080
What are you saying?

352
24:23.160 --> 24:25.000
Your daughter slapped my daughter.

353
24:25.080 --> 24:27.240
She tried to stab her with scissors too.

354
24:27.320 --> 24:29.840
I didn't know. Well?

355
24:29.920 --> 24:32.320
How is your daughter? Is she dead yet?

356
24:33.240 --> 24:34.960
I can reserve a funeral pavilion for you.

357
24:35.040 --> 24:37.680
There are a lot of funerals lately.

358
24:37.760 --> 24:41.080
Without connections, it's hard to get one.

359
24:42.080 --> 24:44.640
If you can't get a pavilion,

360
24:44.720 --> 24:46.800
why not bury her and use her as fertilizer?

361
24:50.320 --> 24:51.680
-How could you? -Are you crazy?

362
24:52.840 --> 24:54.320
Stop!

363
24:54.400 --> 24:55.280
How could you?

364
24:58.600 --> 25:00.240
Your daughter

365
25:00.320 --> 25:02.240
did something wrong. She slapped my daughter.

366
25:02.320 --> 25:03.960
Instead of feeling guilty,

367
25:04.040 --> 25:06.400
you sit here laughing and enjoying it.

368
25:06.480 --> 25:09.400
Now I understand why your daughter is so vicious.

369
25:09.480 --> 25:11.520
She has a mother like you.

370
25:11.600 --> 25:12.560
No conscience at all.

371
25:12.640 --> 25:14.400
You're nothing but garbage to society.

372
25:14.480 --> 25:15.720
That's enough.

373
25:15.800 --> 25:18.040
I sent my daughter to good schools and raised her

374
25:18.120 --> 25:20.800
like a proper lady. Not like you low-class people who went

375
25:20.880 --> 25:24.040
to temple schools. Your classroom was probably right next to the crematorium.

376
25:24.120 --> 25:26.720
No wonder wandering evil spirits

377
25:26.800 --> 25:29.480
possessed you and made you act so trashy.

378
25:30.120 --> 25:31.920
Exactly. So low-class.

379
25:32.000 --> 25:33.880
She uses violence to solve everything.

380
25:33.960 --> 25:34.840
Madam.

381
25:34.920 --> 25:37.680
Madam, don't fight back. We're civilized people.

382
25:37.760 --> 25:40.600
We'll let the law handle her.

383
25:41.200 --> 25:42.520
The law?

384
25:42.600 --> 25:44.400
Are you crazy?!

385
25:44.480 --> 25:46.080
Too bad I don't have a pestle.

386
25:46.160 --> 25:48.040
I'd shove it down your throat.

387
25:48.120 --> 25:50.960
You vile, low-class trash.

388
25:51.040 --> 25:53.400
I'm calling the police and having them drag you away.

389
25:53.480 --> 25:56.080
Here, madam.

390
25:56.160 --> 25:57.440
Call them. Call right now.

391
25:57.520 --> 25:59.920
Go ahead. Call.

392
26:00.000 --> 26:02.840
At worst, what I did is a minor assault case.

393
26:02.920 --> 26:04.240
A small fine, a few hundred tops.

394
26:04.960 --> 26:06.440
But your daughter,

395
26:06.520 --> 26:08.200
attempted murder.

396
26:08.280 --> 26:11.200
Think about what she could be facing.

397
26:13.040 --> 26:14.400
Go on. Call.

398
26:14.480 --> 26:16.840
Madam, call. If you won't,

399
26:16.920 --> 26:18.040
I will.

400
26:18.120 --> 26:19.360
Don't challenge the system.

401
26:19.440 --> 26:20.800
Hello? Hello?

402
26:20.880 --> 26:22.800
Hey!

403
26:22.880 --> 26:24.360
Where is your daughter?

404
26:25.880 --> 26:27.360
I asked where she is.

405
26:28.080 --> 26:30.480
-Mom. -Get her and make her apologize.

406
26:30.560 --> 26:33.040
Mom. Mom, stop. I don't want any more trouble.

407
26:34.400 --> 26:35.760
Don't give in to them.

408
26:35.840 --> 26:39.480
Today she only slapped you. What is she going to do next time?

409
26:40.080 --> 26:42.320
Chaya probably won't dare do anything again, Mom.

410
26:43.520 --> 26:44.640
Aunt Liu.

411
26:45.600 --> 26:48.400
I think you should take Chayanee to see a psychiatrist.

412
26:48.480 --> 26:49.600
It's time

413
26:49.680 --> 26:52.800
someone properly helped her deal with what's going on.

414
26:53.960 --> 26:56.480
Are you calling my daughter crazy?

415
26:56.560 --> 26:57.880
Aunt Liu.

416
26:57.960 --> 26:59.840
You need to change that way of thinking.

417
26:59.920 --> 27:03.360
Seeing a psychiatrist doesn't mean someone is crazy.

418
27:03.960 --> 27:05.520
You raised Chayanee.

419
27:05.600 --> 27:08.800
You know what her personality and temper are like.

420
27:08.880 --> 27:11.120
Please listen to me before it's too late.

421
27:13.200 --> 27:15.800
And I'm warning both of you.

422
27:15.880 --> 27:18.640
Stay away from my daughter.

423
27:18.720 --> 27:21.840
If anyone hurts her again,

424
27:21.920 --> 27:24.520
next time I won't stop at slapping.

425
27:26.320 --> 27:27.320
What are you gonna do?

426
27:30.000 --> 27:32.400
Try me and find out.

427
27:47.400 --> 27:48.640
Madam, calm down.

428
27:55.880 --> 27:58.600
Mom. Don't do that again.

429
27:58.680 --> 28:01.120
If they press charges, you could get in trouble.

430
28:01.200 --> 28:05.160
I don't care. They used violence first, so I gave it back.

431
28:05.240 --> 28:07.120
An eye for an eye.

432
28:07.200 --> 28:09.600
I will never let anyone hurt my daughter.

433
28:10.960 --> 28:12.160
Mom,

434
28:12.240 --> 28:16.280
just knowing that you love me and worry about me makes me happy.

435
28:16.360 --> 28:20.240
And you need to be careful.

436
28:20.320 --> 28:22.400
Her mother enables her this much.

437
28:22.480 --> 28:25.280
Chayanee isn't going to let this go.

438
28:25.360 --> 28:28.600
I know. I'll be much more careful.

439
28:30.920 --> 28:32.640
I'm still furious.

440
28:35.560 --> 28:37.040
Aunt Ann, what is it?

441
28:38.880 --> 28:40.920
I wanted to talk to you

442
28:41.000 --> 28:42.400
about Madam Hathai.

443
28:42.480 --> 28:44.080
Did Mom cause another problem?

444
28:44.160 --> 28:46.240
She hasn't done anything wrong,

445
28:46.320 --> 28:50.720
but I think she may be falling for that man.

446
28:51.640 --> 28:54.360
A few days ago, when he stopped replying to her messages,

447
28:54.440 --> 28:56.640
she became really down.

448
28:56.720 --> 28:58.440
Then the moment

449
28:58.520 --> 29:02.480
he replied, she brightened right up.

450
29:02.560 --> 29:03.840
I'm afraid

451
29:04.560 --> 29:07.440
she might get fooled by another man.

452
29:09.240 --> 29:11.240
Thank you so much for telling me.

453
29:11.320 --> 29:13.680
I'll keep an eye out and make sure there's no trouble.

454
29:23.160 --> 29:25.400
Madam,

455
29:25.480 --> 29:27.880
Hathai is coming after you, right?

456
29:27.960 --> 29:29.440
Don't let her get away with it.

457
29:29.520 --> 29:30.920
Here. Use this.

458
29:31.960 --> 29:33.920
Chamoi. Get that thing away from me.

459
29:34.000 --> 29:36.080
What if I snap and actually do it?

460
29:36.160 --> 29:37.960
You really are trying to send me to prison.

461
29:38.040 --> 29:39.760
Oh, right.

462
29:41.200 --> 29:43.840
Mom. You have to deal with this for me.

463
29:43.920 --> 29:45.240
We can't handle it, miss.

464
29:45.320 --> 29:48.200
Madam and I barely survived dealing with them ourselves.

465
29:48.280 --> 29:52.200
Chayanee, did you really intend to kill Hathaya?

466
29:52.280 --> 29:53.520
Yes.

467
29:54.120 --> 29:56.520
She's trying to steal Raiwin from me.

468
29:56.600 --> 29:58.600
She turned Raiwin against me

469
29:58.680 --> 30:00.960
so badly that he wants to break up with me.

470
30:01.040 --> 30:05.600
No wonder Hathai was furious and came after me.

471
30:05.680 --> 30:07.440
She hurt you?

472
30:08.640 --> 30:11.240
Where are they? I'll kill both mother and daughter.

473
30:11.320 --> 30:13.600
Wait. Stop.

474
30:13.680 --> 30:15.920
Enough. You started it.

475
30:16.000 --> 30:18.760
If this gets any bigger, Grandpa will hear about it.

476
30:18.840 --> 30:21.480
So you're just going to let them bully me?

477
30:21.560 --> 30:22.680
I hate her.

478
30:22.760 --> 30:25.360
I will never live under the same roof with her.

479
30:25.440 --> 30:26.760
I understand.

480
30:26.840 --> 30:28.600
But what can we use against her?

481
30:29.400 --> 30:31.240
Hathaya wants to steal Raiwin

482
30:32.480 --> 30:34.720
because she's desperate for a man.

483
30:34.800 --> 30:37.200
I'll give her all the men she can handle.

484
30:38.480 --> 30:39.680
What are you planning now?

485
30:53.640 --> 30:54.840
Hathaya.

486
30:56.120 --> 30:58.640
After you went home yesterday, did Chayanee bother you again?

487
31:00.320 --> 31:02.520
You don't have to go out of your way to drive me.

488
31:02.600 --> 31:04.040
It's fine.

489
31:04.120 --> 31:07.800
If anything happens, tell me. Don't hesitate.

490
31:07.880 --> 31:08.880
I'm happy to help.

491
31:10.160 --> 31:11.360
Thank you.

492
31:11.440 --> 31:13.760
All right. I'm heading to work.

493
31:28.280 --> 31:30.200
Has Pong arrived yet, Mom?

494
31:30.280 --> 31:32.120
I already called him.

495
31:40.520 --> 31:43.760
I told you to find some rough men. Where are they?

496
31:56.280 --> 31:57.560
Do you approve, miss?

497
32:08.000 --> 32:09.640
If you succeed tonight,

498
32:10.440 --> 32:12.040
I'll give you a bonus.

499
32:15.240 --> 32:16.080
Thank you.

500
32:17.960 --> 32:19.000
Everyone.

501
32:19.880 --> 32:21.440
Get to work.

502
32:21.520 --> 32:25.120
Make yourselves worth the money. Go.

503
32:31.000 --> 32:32.720
Savage.

504
32:34.040 --> 32:36.040
Chayanee.

505
32:36.120 --> 32:37.600
Isn't this going too far?

506
32:39.960 --> 32:41.640
It won't kill her.

507
32:42.440 --> 32:46.480
I want to scare her so badly that she'll be afraid of men for the rest of her life.

508
33:01.560 --> 33:03.200
Come on. Faster. We're almost done.

509
33:06.720 --> 33:08.000
Boss.

510
33:08.080 --> 33:11.360
Pong brought in a whole group of workers.

511
33:11.440 --> 33:14.040
Every one of these guys has walked off the job before.

512
33:24.000 --> 33:25.880
Why didn't you tell me

513
33:25.960 --> 33:27.320
before bringing these men back?

514
33:27.960 --> 33:31.160
I apologize, boss.

515
33:31.240 --> 33:34.040
You said I hadn't done the work properly,

516
33:34.120 --> 33:36.880
so I brought them back to fix everything.

517
33:36.960 --> 33:40.760
And you don't have to pay them a single baht.

518
33:41.480 --> 33:43.160
No matter what you do,

519
33:44.200 --> 33:48.160
you report it to me first. Every time.

520
33:49.840 --> 33:51.200
Then,

521
33:51.960 --> 33:54.840
I apologize again.

522
33:55.520 --> 33:58.600
But you're not heartless enough

523
33:58.680 --> 34:01.840
to throw out workers who realized they were wrong and came back,

524
34:01.920 --> 34:02.880
are you?

525
34:03.520 --> 34:05.000
They're already here.

526
34:05.080 --> 34:07.280
Finish the job. Then don't come back again.

527
34:09.159 --> 34:11.679
Thank you so much, boss.

528
34:13.040 --> 34:14.120
You're the best.

529
34:14.920 --> 34:16.400
Come on.

530
34:16.480 --> 34:18.960
Show some respect.

531
34:19.040 --> 34:20.719
Thank the boss.

532
34:20.800 --> 34:23.639
He's kind enough to let you keep working.

533
34:23.719 --> 34:25.159
Say thank you!

534
34:25.239 --> 34:29.280
-Thank you, boss. -Thank you, boss.

535
34:44.199 --> 34:46.040
Keep an eye on them.

536
34:46.960 --> 34:48.360
I've got a bad feeling.

537
34:48.440 --> 34:50.159
Same here, boss.

538
34:50.800 --> 34:53.400
Showing up and working for free?

539
34:53.480 --> 34:55.080
Something's definitely wrong.

540
34:59.440 --> 35:02.120
I'm done with work. I'll come meet you at the construction site.

541
35:02.880 --> 35:04.000
Okay.

542
35:05.280 --> 35:07.080
Miss Hathaya,

543
35:07.160 --> 35:08.560
I'm really sorry.

544
35:08.640 --> 35:11.760
I forgot to give you the accounts. Could you finish checking them today?

545
35:11.840 --> 35:14.000
I have to submit the report to Mr. Pichai tomorrow.

546
35:16.120 --> 35:18.440
Sure. I'll take care of it.

547
35:19.440 --> 35:21.360
-I'm sorry. -It's okay.

548
35:34.160 --> 35:35.440
Keep your mouth shut.

549
35:37.040 --> 35:37.880
Yes.

550
35:48.320 --> 35:51.000
Pong. Why are you still here?

551
35:51.080 --> 35:53.960
I want to go home more than anyone, boss.

552
35:54.040 --> 35:55.280
I've been working all day.

553
35:55.360 --> 35:58.520
But I promised you I'd finish this.

554
35:58.600 --> 36:00.880
Even if I have to work through the night,

555
36:00.960 --> 36:02.560
I'm going to get it done.

556
36:02.640 --> 36:05.480
There's a birthday party for one of the workers tonight.

557
36:05.560 --> 36:07.280
You should go. I'll watch these guys.

558
36:08.840 --> 36:10.080
No.

559
36:11.040 --> 36:12.440
You go on my behalf.

560
36:13.720 --> 36:14.840
I'll stay here.

561
36:15.880 --> 36:17.480
Wow, boss.

562
36:17.560 --> 36:19.360
I feel terrible making you do that.

563
36:19.440 --> 36:21.520
Anyway, I'm off. I'll eat extra for you.

564
36:21.600 --> 36:24.360
You should've told me sooner instead of making me stand here.

565
36:31.920 --> 36:34.440
Boss, you're still here?

566
36:36.720 --> 36:40.600
You're sacrificing your valuable time just to watch us work.

567
36:40.680 --> 36:42.640
Hey, guys.

568
36:43.240 --> 36:45.520
Show the boss what you can do.

569
36:45.600 --> 36:47.600
Show him how good we are.

570
36:48.720 --> 36:51.680
-Yes, boss. -Yes, boss.

571
37:03.360 --> 37:04.680
Mom.

572
37:06.560 --> 37:08.320
You came in so quietly. You scared me.

573
37:08.400 --> 37:11.360
I saw that you still hadn't come home, so I came to pick you up.

574
37:12.240 --> 37:14.680
You're still not done?

575
37:14.760 --> 37:16.440
I got a little extra work.

576
37:17.280 --> 37:19.400
I'm happy for you.

577
37:19.480 --> 37:22.040
Grandpa trusts you enough to let you handle the accounts.

578
37:24.120 --> 37:27.920
Keep working. I'll sit here and wait. Then we can go home together.

579
37:28.000 --> 37:29.120
Okay.

580
37:31.800 --> 37:33.880
You can charge your phone. The outlet's over there.

581
37:33.960 --> 37:35.160
Yes?

582
37:37.440 --> 37:38.680
Madam.

583
37:39.320 --> 37:41.480
Hathai is sitting there watching over her daughter.

584
37:43.720 --> 37:45.000
What a nuisance.

585
37:45.640 --> 37:49.440
If her mother stays with her, my whole plan is ruined.

586
37:49.520 --> 37:51.920
No, it isn't. I'll have Yai

587
37:52.000 --> 37:53.960
lure Hathai away.

588
37:54.040 --> 37:55.440
Who's Yai?

589
37:56.040 --> 37:57.080
Pong.

590
38:02.600 --> 38:03.880
Pong.

591
38:03.960 --> 38:05.600
Call Hathai right now.

592
38:05.680 --> 38:07.240
Tick her into leaving the office.

593
38:09.240 --> 38:11.960
I'm back. Come have dinner with me.

594
38:12.040 --> 38:15.000
I bought you a designer handbag.

595
38:15.080 --> 38:17.080
But I'm only free tonight.

596
38:17.600 --> 38:19.240
I really want to see you.

597
38:22.640 --> 38:24.080
Did that man message you, Mom?

598
38:25.720 --> 38:27.000
No.

599
38:27.080 --> 38:29.400
Mom. I'm serious.

600
38:30.040 --> 38:33.960
There's something strange about that man. I don't really trust him.

601
38:36.520 --> 38:41.080
It's an old friend of mine from back when I had the restaurant.

602
38:41.160 --> 38:42.480
And

603
38:42.560 --> 38:46.560
she's moving to Italy with her husband, so she invited me out to dinner.

604
38:46.640 --> 38:48.040
Oh?

605
38:48.120 --> 38:51.600
Then go. I can go home with Ramil.

606
38:52.440 --> 38:53.480
You sure?

607
38:57.840 --> 38:58.800
Then I'll go.

608
38:58.880 --> 39:01.200
-Have fun. -Okay.

609
39:25.840 --> 39:27.520
A man sends her a few messages

610
39:27.600 --> 39:29.120
and she leaves her girl immediately.

611
39:29.200 --> 39:33.080
Right? Madam, don't ever be like that.

612
39:33.680 --> 39:35.200
Chamoi.

613
39:36.120 --> 39:38.840
So what do we do next?

614
39:39.440 --> 39:41.640
Mom, call Pong and tell him to move now.

615
39:42.280 --> 39:43.720
Get Ramil out of the way.

616
39:47.240 --> 39:48.760
Tomorrow, clean up this whole area.

617
39:49.480 --> 39:50.560
Yeah.

618
39:52.880 --> 39:55.040
Everything's done, boss.

619
39:55.680 --> 39:59.280
I did it perfectly.

620
39:59.360 --> 40:00.480
Feel free inspect it.

621
40:01.400 --> 40:03.080
Thanks for fixing it.

622
40:03.160 --> 40:05.680
But next time,

623
40:05.760 --> 40:07.360
do it properly the first time.

624
40:08.000 --> 40:10.040
So neither of us wastes time fixing it.

625
40:11.560 --> 40:14.720
Then I sincerely apologize, boss.

626
40:14.800 --> 40:17.240
Truly. From the bottom of my heart.

627
40:17.320 --> 40:20.240
Come on. Apologize to the boss.

628
40:20.320 --> 40:22.360
Even after you screwed up, he still forgave you.

629
40:23.000 --> 40:24.520
-Apologize. -We're sorry.

630
40:24.600 --> 40:26.360
-We're sorry. -We're sorry.

631
40:26.440 --> 40:28.320
That's more like it.

632
40:30.160 --> 40:31.800
May I head home now?

633
40:31.880 --> 40:36.400
I want a good night's sleep so I can do great work for you tomorrow.

634
40:37.440 --> 40:38.560
Good night, boss.

635
40:40.440 --> 40:43.400
-Good night, boss. -Good night, boss.

636
40:56.920 --> 40:57.960
Hello.

637
40:59.000 --> 41:00.560
Yes, this is Ramil.

638
41:02.120 --> 41:03.120
What?

639
41:03.800 --> 41:05.640
One of my workers had an accident?

640
41:05.720 --> 41:07.160
He hit a ten-wheeler?

641
41:07.840 --> 41:09.680
All right. I'm coming right now.

642
41:18.000 --> 41:18.840
Wow.

643
41:18.920 --> 41:21.520
You guys are damn good actors.

644
41:21.600 --> 41:25.000
Maybe I should nominate you for Best Supporting Actor.

645
41:25.080 --> 41:25.960
How about that?

646
41:26.040 --> 41:27.160
Sounds good, boss.

647
41:29.120 --> 41:30.160
Come on.

648
41:30.680 --> 41:32.000
Let's go have some fun.

649
41:32.080 --> 41:33.280
Let's go.

650
41:33.360 --> 41:34.560
Come on.

651
41:35.560 --> 41:37.560
Go take care of your worker first.

652
41:37.640 --> 41:39.800
Don't worry about me. When I'm done, I'll come find you.

653
41:40.880 --> 41:42.560
Okay. Okay.

654
42:54.480 --> 42:55.720
Come here!

655
43:00.680 --> 43:01.640
Hey! Hey!

656
43:01.720 --> 43:02.680
Quickly!

657
43:02.760 --> 43:04.280
Hurry up!

658
43:05.880 --> 43:07.080
Go.

659
43:13.600 --> 43:16.520
Madam, Hathaya got away.

660
43:16.600 --> 43:17.600
She won't get far.

661
43:17.680 --> 43:21.120
Chayanee, I think this is getting too violent.

662
43:21.200 --> 43:22.840
This could turn into something serious.

663
43:22.920 --> 43:24.640
Call Pong and tell him to stop.

664
43:24.720 --> 43:26.680
We can't stop now, Mom.

665
43:26.760 --> 43:30.120
She hurt me. She has to pay.

666
43:56.960 --> 43:59.600
Let go of me!

667
44:01.200 --> 44:05.160
Chayanee, let's go home. I feel awful about this.

668
44:07.000 --> 44:08.040
Madam.

669
44:08.120 --> 44:10.200
Madam. Look over there.

670
44:10.280 --> 44:13.520
Ramil came back to help Hathaya.

671
44:14.960 --> 44:16.680
What do we do?

672
44:25.000 --> 44:26.640
The office is closed.

673
44:26.720 --> 44:28.000
I came to pick up Hathaya.

674
44:28.080 --> 44:29.560
Hathaya already went home.

675
44:29.640 --> 44:30.760
You saw her leave?

676
44:30.840 --> 44:32.880
Yes. I saw her go home.

677
44:32.960 --> 44:35.920
You should leave too. Stop hanging around here.

678
44:36.000 --> 44:39.520
If anything goes missing, I'll assume you came here to steal from my office.

679
44:43.120 --> 44:44.080
Hathaya.

680
44:47.320 --> 44:48.280
Oh?

681
44:49.720 --> 44:51.560
I told you the office was closed.

682
44:52.880 --> 44:53.880
What happened here?

683
44:55.320 --> 44:56.920
Probably a break-in.

684
44:57.000 --> 44:58.880
Go home. I'll call the police.

685
44:58.960 --> 45:00.480
No.

686
45:00.560 --> 45:01.840
Hathaya was here.

687
45:02.880 --> 45:04.960
Hathaya. Hathaya.

688
45:05.040 --> 45:05.920
Ramil.

689
45:06.000 --> 45:07.240
Stop.

690
45:11.160 --> 45:12.400
Oh my.

691
45:12.480 --> 45:13.360
Where is Hathaya?

692
45:15.080 --> 45:16.840
I asked where she is.

693
45:16.920 --> 45:17.960
I don't know.

694
45:18.040 --> 45:20.680
You're lying. You just told me she already left.

695
45:20.760 --> 45:23.160
I really thought she had gone home.

696
45:23.240 --> 45:25.360
If anything happens to Hathaya,

697
45:27.360 --> 45:28.880
you're responsible.

698
45:33.080 --> 45:36.200
Chayanee. Ramil came back to help Hathaya.

699
45:36.280 --> 45:38.640
What do we do?

700
45:39.480 --> 45:41.000
By the time he finds her…

701
45:45.880 --> 45:47.520
Help!

702
45:47.600 --> 45:48.680
Help me!

703
45:49.680 --> 45:51.520
Don't waste your voice.

704
45:52.640 --> 45:54.000
Save it for when I get serious.

705
45:55.240 --> 45:56.600
Help.

706
45:56.680 --> 45:58.480
I told you not to use your voice.

707
46:03.240 --> 46:04.160
Ramil!

708
46:14.200 --> 46:16.080
Get lost!

709
46:19.320 --> 46:20.680
Stop!

710
46:20.760 --> 46:22.640
-Get him up. -Ramil.

711
46:22.720 --> 46:25.280
So tough, huh? Bring him here.

712
46:25.360 --> 46:26.520
Let me see the face of this tough guy.

713
46:28.400 --> 46:30.120
What were you thinking?

714
46:40.440 --> 46:41.440
Ramil.

715
46:42.400 --> 46:44.520
Get up if you're so tough.

716
46:45.160 --> 46:46.680
Not so strong now, are you?

717
46:47.200 --> 46:48.320
Hey.

718
46:49.280 --> 46:50.640
Get up.

719
46:52.320 --> 46:54.080
Well?

720
46:54.160 --> 46:55.400
Don't touch me.

721
46:56.480 --> 46:58.440
Enough. Enough!

722
47:02.160 --> 47:04.720
Please don't hurt him. I'm begging you.

723
47:04.800 --> 47:07.400
Stop. Please.

724
47:07.480 --> 47:08.880
Stop!

725
47:08.960 --> 47:11.720
Take this!

726
47:11.800 --> 47:14.240
Don't hurt him.

727
47:23.560 --> 47:25.320
Chayanee.

728
47:25.400 --> 47:28.760
I don't want to stay here anymore. Let's go home.

729
47:29.800 --> 47:33.160
-Stop. Please. -What?

730
47:33.240 --> 47:34.680
Enough. Don't hurt him.

731
47:35.760 --> 47:37.160
Stop, please.

732
47:38.040 --> 47:39.000
I'm begging you.

733
47:39.760 --> 47:41.160
You love him that much?

734
47:46.200 --> 47:47.440
Hey.

735
47:50.200 --> 47:52.120
Come here.

736
47:53.400 --> 47:54.480
Come with me.

737
47:55.920 --> 47:57.160
Over here.

738
47:59.000 --> 48:02.120
Here. This place is perfect.

739
48:03.520 --> 48:05.440
You love him that much?

740
48:05.520 --> 48:06.800
Hm?

741
48:06.880 --> 48:08.040
You love him?

742
48:10.800 --> 48:11.960
Then hurry up.

743
48:12.480 --> 48:15.000
If you want me to let him go,

744
48:15.840 --> 48:16.880
come here.

745
48:21.320 --> 48:22.160
Come on.

746
48:25.880 --> 48:27.840
I don't like women who refuse me.

747
48:30.240 --> 48:31.600
Hurry up!

748
48:34.080 --> 48:35.480
-Come here. -Don't.

749
48:36.680 --> 48:38.280
You're dying and still want her?

750
48:38.360 --> 48:39.480
Hold him.

751
48:39.560 --> 48:41.040
Ramil.

752
48:42.760 --> 48:44.320
I'll do what you want. I'll do it.

753
48:44.400 --> 48:46.440
No. Hathaya.

754
48:46.520 --> 48:49.600
-Hathaya, don't! -Hold him down.

755
48:50.760 --> 48:52.000
Hathaya, don't go.

756
48:52.080 --> 48:54.600
Come on. Don't make this difficult.

757
48:55.640 --> 48:58.120
I don't like women who refuse me.

758
48:58.200 --> 49:00.640
Come on.

759
49:03.760 --> 49:05.440
Make sure your men stay well hidden

760
49:06.000 --> 49:07.320
or it will be a big problem.

761
49:07.400 --> 49:08.920
And don't get careless.

762
49:09.000 --> 49:10.680
If anything happens,

763
49:10.760 --> 49:12.160
don't drag me into it.

764
49:12.240 --> 49:13.840
If we can't get rid of Hathaya,

765
49:13.920 --> 49:15.800
then we'll go after her mother instead.

766
49:15.880 --> 49:16.960
Aren't you going to eat?

767
49:17.040 --> 49:18.360
It still hurts.

768
49:19.240 --> 49:22.000
Whenever I hold a spoon, I get

769
49:22.720 --> 49:24.440
this sharp pain.

770
49:24.520 --> 49:27.320
It's already this late, and I still can't get in touch with Mom.

771
49:27.400 --> 49:30.200
NEXT EPISODE

772
51:25.880 --> 51:29.800
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
